    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ugly Photos Are Popular in China?",
      "",
      "Recently, a new mobile app has become very popular in China.",
      "This app has a special feature that can turn photos of people and animals into the appearance of clay sculptures.",
      "This clay appearance looks ugly, but it’s also very cute.",
      "",
      "This app is called Remini.",
      "During the May Day holiday in 2024, many people went on vacation.",
      "They used this app to make videos and then posted them online, which were liked by many people.",
      "Many people say that this app makes some photos interesting.",
      "They like these kinds of photos and don’t just want to see beautiful photos."
    ]
  }
